{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Reenchant</i>, you take on the role of an ancient Tree Spirit, defending your home against relentless lumberjacks. As they tear down your forest, it's up to you to restore nature and preserve its beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your forest against the lumberjacks without harming them. Mana Trees are the source of your powers. You have to protect them at all cost. But at night, you are save. You might just fly along and enjoy their beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regrow apple trees. Their fruits will pacify the axe man, and following trees won't be harmed. Birches  slow them down, while oaks with magic bark will blunt axes, and tire the man. Not enough to leave your realm, but enough to protect your forest until that day you are ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend Forest Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Reenchant, Helping the creatures of the forest is as important as growing trees. Oh... those ducklings always get lost ... Luckily you are around to aid them. Here is frog in need of water - a deer looking for a treat. Ah ... those fairyflies are hard to catch. But I'm sure you can handle that. You can handle anything you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything else fails: Drop some Mana. That will cause the lumberjacks to sit down and meditate. Collect Mana to get a speed boost. Drop it on your path and retrieve it for a swift return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short Playtime, High Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lowest difficulty will take you 2\u20134 hours to complete. For those seeking more, higher difficulty levels and procedurally generated tree placements offer further challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without Words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> features no spoken or written words. Discover its secrets by observing and exploring your way through the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why I made Reenchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> was born in the depths of winter, when my longing for green trees became too strong to ignore. I turned to <i>Kingdom</i>, a game I\u2019ve always loved for its mystical forests, but felt sad when, in the end, all the trees were chopped down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to reverse that feeling, to create a game where nature fights back and beauty triumphs over destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I find peace in my daily walks through the forest and hope some of that meditative joy has found its way into <i>Reenchant</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984730?t=1769263191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984730?t=1769263191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/771792b8b3c46843eeb769cf1f550eb4847d161e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769263191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/771792b8b3c46843eeb769cf1f550eb4847d161e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769263191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3984990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Reenchant</i>, you take on the role of an ancient Tree Spirit, defending your home against relentless lumberjacks. As they tear down your forest, it's up to you to restore nature and preserve its beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your forest against the lumberjacks without harming them. Mana Trees are the source of your powers. You have to protect them at all cost. But at night, you are save. You might just fly along and enjoy their beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regrow apple trees. Their fruits will pacify the axe man, and following trees won't be harmed. Birches  slow them down, while oaks with magic bark will blunt axes, and tire the man. Not enough to leave your realm, but enough to protect your forest until that day you are ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend Forest Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Reenchant, Helping the creatures of the forest is as important as growing trees. Oh... those ducklings always get lost ... Luckily you are around to aid them. Here is frog in need of water - a deer looking for a treat. Ah ... those fairyflies are hard to catch. But I'm sure you can handle that. You can handle anything you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything else fails: Drop some Mana. That will cause the lumberjacks to sit down and meditate. Collect Mana to get a speed boost. Drop it on your path and retrieve it for a swift return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.poster.avif?t=1769263191\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.webm?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.mp4?t=1769263191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short Playtime, High Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lowest difficulty will take you 2\u20134 hours to complete. For those seeking more, higher difficulty levels and procedurally generated tree placements offer further challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without Words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> features no spoken or written words. Discover its secrets by observing and exploring your way through the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why I made Reenchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> was born in the depths of winter, when my longing for green trees became too strong to ignore. I turned to <i>Kingdom</i>, a game I\u2019ve always loved for its mystical forests, but felt sad when, in the end, all the trees were chopped down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to reverse that feeling, to create a game where nature fights back and beauty triumphs over destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I find peace in my daily walks through the forest and hope some of that meditative joy has found its way into <i>Reenchant</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Surfin Bird Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.st